error: rsjs boundary: `rsjs::island(...)` cannot capture parent reactive signal `selected`

       Why:
         Explicit child islands hydrate as independent client scopes. A parent signal is not serializable as live child state across that boundary.

       Use one of:
         - Pass a plain server value into the child island.
         - Keep the reactive markup directly inside the parent island.
         - Give the child island its own query, mutation, signal, or custom-event channel.

       Tracked feature:
         server_boundary.island_signal_capture
  --> tests/ui/conformance/fail/41_island_signal_capture.rs:32:61
   |
32 |                 {rsjs::island(ChildWithServerValue { value: selected.get() })}
   |                                                             ^^^^^^^^
